@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #8899AA
hide circle
hide empty members
title 第 5 週：同一步的三個資料，裝進一個 MissionStep 物件

class MissionLog #FFE8D6 {
  + {static} main(args : String[]) : void
  ~ {static} runMission(script, energy, samples) : void
  ~ {static} countCommands(history) : int[]
  ~ {static} printReplay(history) : void
  ~ {static} printSummary(scriptLength, history) : void
}
class MissionStep #DFF3E3 {
  - command : int
  - energy : int
  - result : String
  + MissionStep(command, energy, result)
  + getCommand() : int
  + getEnergy() : int
  + getResult() : String
  + isSuccessful() : boolean
}
class FixedScriptMission #F4F4F4
FixedScriptMission ..> MissionLog : 呼叫 runMission
MissionLog ..> MissionStep : new MissionStep(...)\n讀 getter
note left of MissionLog
  energy、samples、actionCount
  <b>仍是 runMission 的區域變數</b>
  行動規則的 switch 也還在這裡
  → 第 6 週要處理
end note
note right of MissionStep
  建構子一次收齊三個值，
  沒有 setter：已發生的紀錄不再修改
end note
@enduml
